
                                                VALIDPATTERN COMMAND


Sets or tests VALIDPATTERN field.

Below is the syntax :
                                          validpattern 	-fc {"test"|"set"} 

---------------+----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
SWITCHES       |    DESCRIPTION
---------------+----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   -fc         |    Takes values "set" or "test". "set" to update the validpattern value and "test" to
               |    test the field value. Mandatory switch.
---------------+----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Example:
	read -in medc18.hex
	blklink -start 0x8fc0020 -next 0x8fd0000
	blklink -start 0x8fd0000 -next 0x0
	validpattern -fc set
	write -out output.hex -lyt 0x20
	
